### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health


### ── Entries ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create a glow
POST http://localhost:8000/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry_type": "glow",
  "content": "shipped the auth refactor ahead of schedule",
  "tags": ["backend", "auth"]
}


### Create a grow
POST http://localhost:8000/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry_type": "grow",
  "content": "underestimated the scope of the migration",
  "tags": ["planning"]
}


### Create an entry with an explicit date
POST http://localhost:8000/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry_type": "glow",
  "content": "went to the gym",
  "date": "2026-03-10",
  "tags": ["self-care"]
}


### List all entries (glows and grows)
GET http://localhost:8000/entries


### List only glows
GET http://localhost:8000/entries?entry_type=glow


### List only grows
GET http://localhost:8000/entries?entry_type=grow


### List entries filtered by date
GET http://localhost:8000/entries?date=2026-03-10


### List entries filtered by tag
GET http://localhost:8000/entries?tag={{tag}}


### List entries filtered by multiple tags (AND logic)
GET http://localhost:8000/entries?tag=backend&tag=auth


### List entries with pagination
GET http://localhost:8000/entries?limit=10&offset=0


### Search all entries
GET http://localhost:8000/entries/search?q=auth


### Search only glows
GET http://localhost:8000/entries/search?q=auth&entry_type=glow


### Get a single entry
GET http://localhost:8000/entries/{{entry_id}}


### Get a single entry — content and tags only
GET http://localhost:8000/entries/{{entry_id}}?fields=content,date,tags


### Get a single entry — include internal timestamps
GET http://localhost:8000/entries/{{entry_id}}?fields=id,entry_type,content,date,tags,is_editable,created_at,updated_at


### Update an entry (within 24 hours of creation)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/entries/{{entry_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "created the scaffolding and starter app for the personal-changelog project using claude code"                                    
}


### Update tags on an entry
PATCH http://localhost:8000/entries/{{entry_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tags": ["self-care"]
}


### Delete an entry
DELETE http://localhost:8000/entries/{{entry_id}}


### ── Tags ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all tags (across glows and grows)
GET http://localhost:8000/tags


### List tags for glows only
GET http://localhost:8000/tags?entry_type=glow


### List tags with pagination
GET http://localhost:8000/tags?limit=10&offset=0


### ── Summaries ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Generate a reflection summary
POST http://localhost:8000/summaries/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "period_type": "weekly",
  "start_date": "2026-03-10",
  "end_date": "2026-03-16",
  "summary_type": "reflection"
}


### Generate a performance review summary
POST http://localhost:8000/summaries/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "period_type": "monthly",
  "start_date": "2026-03-01",
  "end_date": "2026-03-31",
  "summary_type": "perf_review"
}


### Generate an opportunities summary
POST http://localhost:8000/summaries/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "period_type": "quarterly",
  "start_date": "2026-01-01",
  "end_date": "2026-03-31",
  "summary_type": "opportunities"
}


### List all summaries
GET http://localhost:8000/summaries


### List summaries filtered by type
GET http://localhost:8000/summaries?summary_type=perf_review


### List summaries filtered by period
GET http://localhost:8000/summaries?period_type=weekly


### Get a single summary
GET http://localhost:8000/summaries/{{summary_id}}
